From: Nicolas Michaut <nicolas@yumilab.com>
Subject: [PATCH] board: sunxi: add SmartPi One defconfig and device tree
Date: 2026-07-26

Add defconfig and device tree for the Yumi Lab SmartPi One board.
Based on nanopi_m1_defconfig (same Allwinner H3 SoC).

DRAM tuned to 576 MHz with ZQ calibration and ODT enabled
for improved memory stability.

The device tree reuses the NanoPi M1 one with custom model and
compatible strings; U-Boot then advertises
fdtfile=sun8i-h3-smartpi-one.dtb so the kernel boots with the
matching SmartPi One device tree shipped by the kernel package.

Signed-off-by: Nicolas Michaut <nicolas@yumilab.com>
---
 arch/arm/dts/Makefile                 |  1 +
 arch/arm/dts/sun8i-h3-smartpi-one.dts | 13 +++++++++++++
 configs/smartpi1_defconfig            | 13 +++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 27 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm/dts/sun8i-h3-smartpi-one.dts
 create mode 100644 configs/smartpi1_defconfig

diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/Makefile b/arch/arm/dts/Makefile
--- a/arch/arm/dts/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/Makefile
@@ -623,4 +623,5 @@
 	sun8i-h3-orangepi-plus2e.dtb \
 	sun8i-h3-orangepi-zero-plus2.dtb \
 	sun8i-h3-rervision-dvk.dtb \
+	sun8i-h3-smartpi-one.dtb \
 	sun8i-h3-zeropi.dtb
diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/sun8i-h3-smartpi-one.dts b/arch/arm/dts/sun8i-h3-smartpi-one.dts
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/sun8i-h3-smartpi-one.dts
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0+ OR MIT)
+/*
+ * Copyright (C) 2026 Yumi Lab <nicolas@yumilab.com>
+ *
+ * Same hardware as the NanoPi M1, custom branding for Yumi SmartPi One.
+ */
+
+#include "sun8i-h3-nanopi-m1.dts"
+
+/ {
+	model = "YUMi SmartPi One";
+	compatible = "yumi,smartpi-one", "allwinner,sun8i-h3";
+};
diff --git a/configs/smartpi1_defconfig b/configs/smartpi1_defconfig
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/configs/smartpi1_defconfig
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+CONFIG_ARM=y
+CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI=y
+CONFIG_DEFAULT_DEVICE_TREE="sun8i-h3-smartpi-one"
+CONFIG_DRAM_CLK=576
+CONFIG_DRAM_ZQ=3881979
+CONFIG_DRAM_ODT_EN=y
+CONFIG_SPL=y
+CONFIG_MACH_SUN8I_H3=y
+# CONFIG_SYS_MALLOC_CLEAR_ON_INIT is not set
+CONFIG_USB_EHCI_HCD=y
+CONFIG_USB_OHCI_HCD=y
+CONFIG_CMD_BMP=y
+CONFIG_SYS_BOARD="smartpi1"
--
2.43.0
